      "explanation": "The doctor did not perform an ideal initial structured screen, but over the episode the family reported current absence of major red flags and the doctor repeatedly gave risk-stratified emergency thresholds, including self/other harm, running away, severe agitation, falls, oversedation, and inability to manage at home.",
