          "quote": "一片药都不能给他"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00344",
          "explanation": "The family later supplied conflicting original-hospital written guidance that basic medication should continue.",
          "quote": "基础药按核对的继续"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00326",
          "explanation": "Even after the line team had reviewed materials, the doctor continued to advise against giving medication.",
          "quote": "今晚仍然不能按任何口头说法自行给药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor appropriately warned against unsupervised sedative use, but then overcorrected into repeated blanket medication withholding despite an original-hospital transition paper and later line review. This amounted to an unsafe medication execution error in an unstable psychiatric discharge transition.",
