        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Despite an initially poor priority statement, the doctor ultimately recognized that the patient needed near-term psychiatric reassessment and gave a short-term timeframe with emergency escalation if red flags appeared.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_psychiatric_followup_priority",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
