        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Cardiology follow-up was not completely omitted and was later correctly deprioritized relative to psychiatric safety. However, the doctor initially misprioritized cardiology and did not actively provide cardiology/neuro emergency red flags, so this remains a minor/moderate responsibility-chain error.",
